abstract: >-
  TFT Lab is an alpha-status research prototype for deterministic tensor
  invariance experiments, quadrature signal construction, and scientific
  sonification. Its numerical demonstrations do not establish a validated
  physical theory.
keywords:
  - tensor invariants
  - quadrature
  - scientific sonification
  - reproducible research
